  "intro": {
    "label": {"en": "WHY SIMPLE", "zh": "为什么 Simple"},
    "text": {"en": "Simple means explicit interfaces—not fewer semantics. Data adapters, model components, training recipes, and benchmark plugins can evolve independently while remaining auditable together.", "zh": "Simple 不是省略语义，而是明确接口。数据 adapter、模型组件、训练 recipe 和 benchmark 插件可以独立演进，同时保持整体可审计。"}
  },
